  "body": "Our vendors are on the move, this will be sold.\r\n\r\nOccupying the coveted corner position in a professional enclave, the property makes the most of its location neighbouring Selwyn Reserve’s native bush, with leafy green views filling every window and birdsong providing your daily soundtrack.\r\n\r\nLovely gardens frame the front door, setting the scene for what lies beyond. On the upper level, natural light saturates the substantial open plan living, dining and kitchen domain, flowing effortlessly out to a large and very private deck overlooking the beautiful native established trees and greenery, the ideal backdrop for summer hosting and quiet evenings alike. Oak floors underfoot and a pitched ceiling add to the sophistication, while the chic kitchen is a dream for entertainers with its walk in pantry and crisp island.\r\n\r\nFour bedrooms occupy the central level, including the primary with walk in robe, ensuite and access to a balcony for morning coffees in the sun. The layout is flexible: use the fourth bedroom as a second sitting room or a full home office. A stylish contemporary family bathroom with bath and shower is also on this floor.\r\n\r\nTwo covered and secure internal access car parks plus a large storage locker complete this impeccable offering. With a well-run body corporate and low levies, this is the ideal lock and leave in the city. Set on a quiet no exit street, the location balances tranquillity with exceptional convenience - Eastridge Shopping Centre is close by, while Mission Bay’s beaches, cafes and lifestyle are within easy reach.\r\n\r\nAstute downsizers, professionals and those seeking a peaceful city base will appreciate this rare combination of style and serenity.",
